    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.25
  m_Text: "Deploy 4 core emotional affects onto your 5 internal organs to direct
    your responses:\n  - Calm (Blue): Stabilizes heart rate, protects composure,
    and grounds speech.\n  - Anxiety (Purple): Emergency alertness; rapid reflexes,
    but taxes composure.\n  - Confidence (Gold): Playful banter & bold charm; counters
    Maya's teasing.\n  - Attraction (Pink): Romantic warmth, emotional intimacy &
    sparks.\nOrgans: Brain (Logic), Voice (Speech), Heart (Passion), Body (Presence),
    Lungs (Oxygen).\nCost: Deploying an affect costs 15 Oxygen (supplied by Lungs)."
